@startuml
!theme spacelab
skinparam MaxMessageSize 150

title API Gateway Resilience & Traffic Management: Comprehensive Resilience Lifecycle

actor Client
participant "API Gateway\n" as Gateway
participant "Discovery Server\n(Eureka)" as Eureka
participant "Orders Service\n(Instance 1)" as Orders1
participant "Orders Service\n(Instance 2)" as Orders2
participant "Fallback Controller\n" as Fallback

== Scenario 1: Healthy Traffic & Load Balancing ==

Client -> Gateway : GET /guitar/orders/api/orders
Gateway -> Eureka : Lookup "ORDERS" service
Eureka --> Gateway : Return [IP_1:8080, IP_2:8081]
Gateway -> Orders1 : Forward Request (Round-Robin)
Orders1 --> Gateway : 200 OK
Gateway --> Client : Successful Response

== Scenario 2: Transient Blip & Retry Pattern ==

Client -> Gateway : GET /guitar/inventory/api/inventory
Gateway -> Orders1 : Attempt 1 (Connection Refused/Timeout)
note right of Gateway : **Retry Pattern Active**: Attempting recovery
Gateway -> Orders2 : Attempt 2 (Exponential Backoff)
Orders2 --> Gateway : 200 OK
Gateway --> Client : Successful Response (Self-Healed)

== Scenario 3: Persistent Failure & Circuit Breaker ==

group Circuit Breaker: CLOSED -> OPEN
    Client -> Gateway : POST /guitar/orders/api/orders
    Gateway -> Orders1 : Request fails (Service Hanging)
    note right of Gateway : **HTTP Timeout Triggered**
    ... Repeated Failures ...
    note right of Gateway : failureRate > 50% threshold met
    Gateway -> Gateway : Trip Breaker to **OPEN**
end

Client -> Gateway : New Request (While Breaker is OPEN)
Gateway -> Gateway : Reject request immediately (Fail-Fast)

group Graceful Degradation & Fallback
    Gateway -> Fallback : Forward to /contactSupport
    Fallback --> Gateway : "Information Temporarily Unavailable"
    Gateway --> Client : User-friendly fallback message:\n"An error occurred. Please try later or contact support!"
end

@enduml